webOS's short ringtones, which Lunacy copies into Android's shared storage
(Notifications/webOS) so that Android and its apps can use them, and which webOS apps see as
/media/internal/ringtones (card/Ringtones.kt).

The ten "(short)" tones from /media/internal/ringtones on the reference TouchPad (webOS CE
3.1.0), copied 2026-11-04, byte for byte: Anticipation, Cymbells, Dulcimer, Flurry, Rain Dance,
Shimmer, Subtle, Treo New, Triangle and Vibes. Treo New alone came with no tags, so pickers
called its artist "Unknown Artist"; it has since been given the others' (ID3v2.4: its title,
artist "webOS", album "webOS Ringtones"), its audio frames unchanged (2026-11-04). The TouchPad's 31 full-length ringtones are left
out to keep Lunacy small (codepoet, 2026-11-04).

